@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Login - success (default admin credentials)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=password123

### Login - wrong password
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=wrongpassword

### Login - unknown user
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=ghost&password=whatever

### Login - missing fields
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=&password=

### Login - wrong method (should return 405)
GET {{host}}/login

### Login - XSS attempt in username (should be escaped in response)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=%3Cscript%3Ealert(1)%3C%2Fscript%3E&password=x

### Login - SQL injection attempt in username (parameterized, should fail safely)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin%27+OR+%271%27%3D%271&password=x
